# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `nvidia-*-cu12` versions can change when the environment is rebuilt. Code that depends on an exact CUDA library version might need updates after a new release.\n"
msgstr "Versi `nvidia-*-cu12` boleh berubah apabila persekitaran dibina semula. Kod yang bergantung pada versi pustaka CUDA yang tepat mungkin memerlukan kemas kini selepas keluaran baharu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request a package {#request-a-package}"
msgstr "Minta pakej {#request-a-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If other users would also need a package, [request it on GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-serverless/issues/new?template=pip_dependency_request.yaml). An accepted package is added to the environment in a later release. Until then, or for a private package, [add it as a wheel](#add-your-own-packages).\n"
msgstr "Jika pengguna lain juga memerlukan sesuatu pakej, [minta di GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-serverless/issues/new?template=pip_dependency_request.yaml). Pakej yang diterima ditambah ke persekitaran dalam keluaran kemudian. Sehingga itu, atau bagi pakej persendirian, [tambahkannya sebagai wheel](#add-your-own-packages).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* REVIEW: issue #2017 removes the request template, but the public PR Qiskit/qiskit-serverless#2651 keeps it. Confirm that the link remains. */}\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add your own packages {#add-your-own-packages}"
msgstr "Tambah pakej anda sendiri {#add-your-own-packages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a package that is not installed, collect its wheel files on your computer, upload them to the workflow's file storage, and install them at the start of the workflow. You upload them again only when they change.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan pakej yang tidak dipasang, kumpulkan fail wheelnya pada komputer anda, muat naik ke storan fail aliran kerja, dan pasang pada permulaan aliran kerja. Anda memuat naiknya semula hanya apabila ia berubah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build wheels {#build-wheels}"
msgstr "Bina wheel {#build-wheels}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The job installs wheels without an internet connection, so each wheel must work with Python 3.12 on Linux (x86_64). Collect the wheels in one folder:\n"
msgstr "Job memasang wheel tanpa sambungan internet, jadi setiap wheel mesti berfungsi dengan Python 3.12 pada Linux (x86_64). Kumpulkan wheel dalam satu folder:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`Local terminal`**\n"
msgstr "**`Local terminal`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With `--platform` and `--python-version`, `pip download` gets wheels for the job's platform, even when you run it on macOS or Windows. It also downloads the package's dependencies, such as `python-dateutil`, `six`, and `tzdata` for `pendulum`. Because the job installs each wheel without its dependencies, upload a wheel for every dependency that the environment lacks, and delete the other wheels from the folder.\n"
msgstr "Dengan `--platform` dan `--python-version`, `pip download` mendapatkan wheel untuk platform job, walaupun anda menjalankannya pada macOS atau Windows. Ia juga memuat turun kebergantungan pakej, seperti `python-dateutil`, `six` dan `tzdata` bagi `pendulum`. Oleh sebab job memasang setiap wheel tanpa kebergantungannya, muat naik wheel bagi setiap kebergantungan yang tiada dalam persekitaran, dan padam wheel lain daripada folder.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A pure-Python wheel (`py3-none-any.whl`) works on any platform. If a package with compiled code has no Linux x86_64 wheel on PyPI, build one on Linux, for example in a `python:3.12` container. Keep the original file names, because `pip` reads the package name, version, and platform from them.\n"
msgstr "Wheel Python tulen (`py3-none-any.whl`) berfungsi pada mana-mana platform. Jika pakej dengan kod terkompil tidak mempunyai wheel Linux x86_64 di PyPI, bina satu di Linux, contohnya dalam kontena `python:3.12`. Kekalkan nama fail asal, kerana `pip` membaca nama pakej, versi dan platform daripadanya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload wheels {#upload-wheels}"
msgstr "Muat naik wheel {#upload-wheels}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the wheels from your local notebook with `add_wheels()`:\n"
msgstr "Muat naik wheel daripada notebook tempatan anda dengan `add_wheels()`:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each path can be a file name or a glob pattern, and `add_wheels()` returns the names of the uploaded wheels. If a pattern matches no files, or matches a file that is not a `.whl` file, `add_wheels()` raises a `QiskitServerlessException`.\n"
msgstr "Setiap laluan boleh berupa nama fail atau corak glob, dan `add_wheels()` mengembalikan nama wheel yang dimuat naik. Jika corak tidak sepadan dengan sebarang fail, atau sepadan dengan fail yang bukan fail `.whl`, `add_wheels()` menimbulkan `QiskitServerlessException`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the workflow before you add wheels, because the wheels are stored with it. They go to a `wheels` folder in the workflow's [file storage](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows), separate from your other files.\n"
msgstr "Muat naik aliran kerja sebelum anda menambah wheel, kerana wheel disimpan bersamanya. Wheel masuk ke folder `wheels` dalam [storan fail](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) aliran kerja, berasingan daripada fail anda yang lain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace or remove wheels {#replace-or-remove-wheels}"
msgstr "Gantikan atau alih keluar wheel {#replace-or-remove-wheels}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see the wheels that are uploaded to a workflow, call `list_wheels()`. To remove wheels, pass their file names to `remove_wheels()`:\n"
msgstr "Untuk melihat wheel yang dimuat naik ke aliran kerja, panggil `list_wheels()`. Untuk mengalih keluar wheel, hantar nama fail wheel tersebut kepada `remove_wheels()`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To upgrade a package, remove the old wheel, and then add the new one. A new version has a different file name, so if you keep the old wheel, `install_uploaded_wheels()` installs both versions.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menaik taraf pakej, alih keluar wheel lama, kemudian tambah yang baharu. Versi baharu mempunyai nama fail yang berbeza, jadi jika anda mengekalkan wheel lama, `install_uploaded_wheels()` memasang kedua-dua versi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install wheels in your workflow {#install-wheels-in-your-workflow}"
msgstr "Pasang wheel dalam aliran kerja anda {#install-wheels-in-your-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit your workflow code to call `install_uploaded_wheels()` before it imports the packages:\n"
msgstr "Sunting kod aliran kerja anda untuk memanggil `install_uploaded_wheels()` sebelum ia mengimport pakej:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"
msgstr "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`install_uploaded_wheels()` installs every wheel in the `wheels` folder. If the workflow has no wheels, the call does nothing. The wheels are installed again in every run, so a large set of wheels adds to the start time of each job.\n"
msgstr "`install_uploaded_wheels()` memasang setiap wheel dalam folder `wheels`. Jika aliran kerja tiada wheel, panggilan itu tidak melakukan apa-apa. Wheel dipasang semula dalam setiap larian, jadi set wheel yang besar menambah masa permulaan setiap job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best practice: bring only missing packages {#best-practice-bring-only-missing-packages}"
msgstr "Amalan terbaik: bawa hanya pakej yang tiada {#best-practice-bring-only-missing-packages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As a best practice, upload wheels only for the packages that the environment lacks. A wheel for an installed package, such as `numpy`, installs a second copy, and the code that imports it can get either copy. Errors from a mismatch appear only when the job runs.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai amalan terbaik, muat naik wheel hanya untuk pakej yang tiada dalam persekitaran. Wheel untuk pakej yang sudah dipasang, seperti `numpy`, memasang salinan kedua, dan kod yang mengimportnya boleh mendapat salah satu salinan. Ralat akibat ketidakpadanan hanya muncul apabila job dijalankan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you upload, check your requirements with `dependency_report()` from your local notebook:\n"
msgstr "Sebelum anda memuat naik, semak keperluan anda dengan `dependency_report()` daripada notebook tempatan anda:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* REVIEW: dependency_report() compares with dependencies_versions() only, so it reports numpy, qiskit, qiskit-ibm-runtime, and qiskit-serverless as \"bring\", although the environment includes them (still true in qiskit-serverless 0.38.0). Fix the report, or keep the note after the list. */}\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* REVIEW: dependency_report() compares with dependencies_versions() only, so it reports numpy, qiskit, qiskit-ibm-runtime, and qiskit-serverless as \"bring\", although the environment includes them (still true in qiskit-serverless 0.38.0). Fix the report, or keep the note after the list. */}\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The report gives each requirement one of the following statuses:\n"
msgstr "Laporan memberi setiap keperluan salah satu daripada status berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`baked`: The environment already provides the package. Do not upload a wheel for it.\n"
msgstr "`baked`: Persekitaran sudah menyediakan pakej itu. Jangan muat naik wheel untuknya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`bring`: The environment lacks the package. Upload a wheel for it.\n"
msgstr "`bring`: Persekitaran tidak mempunyai pakej itu. Muat naik wheel untuknya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`clash`: The environment provides a different version. Change the version that your code requires, or rebuild your package for the installed version.\n"
msgstr "`clash`: Persekitaran menyediakan versi yang berbeza. Tukar versi yang diperlukan oleh kod anda, atau bina semula pakej anda untuk versi yang dipasang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The report checks only the supported packages, so it shows `qiskit`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, `qiskit-serverless`, and `numpy` as `bring`. The environment includes them, so do not upload wheels for them. The report shows `clash` only for an exact `==` version. It shows a range, such as `>=0.10`, as `baked`. The report does not upload any files.\n"
msgstr "Laporan hanya menyemak pakej yang disokong, jadi ia menunjukkan `qiskit`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, `qiskit-serverless` dan `numpy` sebagai `bring`. Persekitaran sudah mengandunginya, jadi jangan muat naik wheel untuknya. Laporan menunjukkan `clash` hanya untuk versi `==` yang tepat. Ia menunjukkan julat, seperti `>=0.10`, sebagai `baked`. Laporan tidak memuat naik sebarang fail.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshoot dependencies {#troubleshoot-dependencies}"
msgstr "Selesaikan masalah kebergantungan {#troubleshoot-dependencies}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Problem | Cause |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| `pip install` fails inside the workflow. | The job cannot reach the internet. [Upload a wheel](#add-your-own-packages) instead. |\n"
"| `ModuleNotFoundError` for a package that you uploaded. | The workflow imports the package before it calls `install_uploaded_wheels()`. |\n"
"| `ModuleNotFoundError` for a dependency of a package that you uploaded. | Wheels are installed without their dependencies. Upload a wheel for the missing dependency. |\n"
"| The error says that a wheel `is not a supported wheel on this platform`. | The wheel is for another operating system or Python version. Get a wheel for Python 3.12 on Linux x86_64. |\n"
"| `install_uploaded_wheels()` fails with `ResolutionImpossible`. | The `wheels` folder has two versions of the same package. Remove the old wheel with [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
"| A CUDA package, such as `cupy`, fails on a GPU compute profile after you upload wheels. | A wheel replaced one of the [CUDA packages](#packages-on-gpu-compute-profiles) that the environment provides. Remove that wheel with [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
"| An installed package, such as `numpy`, fails after you upload wheels. | A wheel installed a second copy of a package that the environment provides. Remove that wheel with [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Masalah | Punca |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| `pip install` gagal di dalam aliran kerja. | Job tidak dapat mencapai internet. [Muat naik wheel](#add-your-own-packages) sebagai gantinya. |\n"
"| `ModuleNotFoundError` untuk pakej yang anda muat naik. | Aliran kerja mengimport pakej itu sebelum ia memanggil `install_uploaded_wheels()`. |\n"
"| `ModuleNotFoundError` untuk kebergantungan bagi pakej yang anda muat naik. | Wheel dipasang tanpa kebergantungannya. Muat naik wheel untuk kebergantungan yang tiada itu. |\n"
"| Ralat menyatakan bahawa wheel `is not a supported wheel on this platform`. | Wheel itu untuk sistem pengendalian atau versi Python yang lain. Dapatkan wheel untuk Python 3.12 pada Linux x86_64. |\n"
"| `install_uploaded_wheels()` gagal dengan `ResolutionImpossible`. | Folder `wheels` mempunyai dua versi pakej yang sama. Alih keluar wheel lama dengan [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
"| Pakej CUDA, seperti `cupy`, gagal pada profil pengiraan GPU selepas anda memuat naik wheel. | Satu wheel menggantikan salah satu daripada [pakej CUDA](#packages-on-gpu-compute-profiles) yang disediakan oleh persekitaran. Alih keluar wheel itu dengan [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
"| Pakej yang dipasang, seperti `numpy`, gagal selepas anda memuat naik wheel. | Satu wheel memasang salinan kedua pakej yang disediakan oleh persekitaran. Alih keluar wheel itu dengan [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
